  aciklama:
  - "Fincan\u0131n\u0131n daha alt-yan duvar\u0131nda, oymac\u0131l\u0131k ve kakmac\u0131l\u0131k
    sanat\u0131yla oraya i\u015Flenmi\u015F gibi duran, y\u0131pranm\u0131\u015F
    bir kalp var {{isim}}. Bu kalbin sahibinin \xFCzerinden belli bir m\xFCddet \"zaman\"
    ge\xE7ti\u011Fini s\xF6yl\xFCyor telvelerin; belki \xFC\xE7-be\u015F ay, belki
    \xFC\xE7-be\u015F sene, belki de \xE7ok daha fazlas\u0131... Fakat ne dersen
    de, sen bu kalbin sahibini, onun g\xFCl\xFC\u015F\xFCn\xFC, g\xF6zlerini ve {{kelime,
    ellerini | kokusunu | \xF6p\xFC\u015F\xFCn\xFC | sar\u0131l\u0131\u015Flar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131
    | teninin dokusunu}} unutamam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n. A\u011Fz\u0131n\u0131 ba\u011Flay\u0131p
    zindana att\u0131\u011F\u0131n y\xFCre\u011Finin i\xE7indeki a\u015Fk\u0131 y\u0131llar
    boyunca diri tutan, belki de ruhunun can penceresinde biriken sevda bu\u011Fusuydu.
    Baksak, eminim o ayr\u0131l\u0131\u011F\u0131n zekat\u0131 olan g\xF6z ya\u015Flar\u0131yla
    olu\u015Fan \xE7apaklar\u0131n kal\u0131nt\u0131lar\u0131, kirpiklerinin kenarlar\u0131nda
    halen duruyordur. Ama yok; senin o ki\u015Fiyle hesab\u0131n hen\xFCz kapanmam\u0131\u015F.
    Ah\u0131n var, alacakl\u0131s\u0131n; ve ilerleyen y\u0131llarda alacaks\u0131n
    {{isim}}...\n\nTelvelerindeki baz\u0131 noktac\u0131klar, ba\u015F\u0131n\u0131n
    \xFCzerinde u\xE7u\u015Fan sinekleri and\u0131r\u0131yor. Bu pek iyiye i\u015Faret
    de\u011Fil. {{kelime, Ba\u011Flar\u0131n\u0131n s\u0131k\u0131 oldu\u011Fu ancak
    yak\u0131n \xE7evrende olmayan birileri | Yak\u0131n \xE7evrende olan, sevdi\u011Fin
    ancak aranda kan ba\u011F\u0131 bulunmayan birileri}}, {{kelime, \xF6n\xFCm\xFCzdeki
    g\xFCnlerde | \xF6n\xFCm\xFCzdeki bir hafta i\xE7erisinde | \xF6n\xFCm\xFCzdeki
    on g\xFCn i\xE7erisinde}} baz\u0131 sa\u011Fl\u0131k sorunlar\u0131 ya\u015Fayabilir.
    Haber ald\u0131\u011F\u0131nda \xFCz\xFClebilir ve bir m\xFCddet endi\u015Felenebilirsin
    {{isim}}. Bu s\xFCre\xE7, o ki\u015Fi ya da ki\u015Filerin aileleri ad\u0131na
    biraz {{kelime, y\u0131prat\u0131c\u0131 | yorucu}} ge\xE7ecek gibi g\xF6z\xFCk\xFCyor.
    Ancak sa\u011Fl\u0131kla atlat\u0131laca\u011F\u0131ndan hi\xE7 \u015F\xFCphem
    yok."
